findings.finding:
All addresses come from AceCombat8.exe of 2026-11-02 (551,201,904 bytes, base 0x140000000). Method:
- read the exe through mmap with mx.py (python -I), plus llvm-objdump ranges;
- reuse prior dumps (seam/dis_net_region.txt 0x147480000-0x14751ffff, flow/gameobj_pp.txt, deep-wire/gm_region.txt 0x1471a0000-0x1471effff);
- run only one exe-reading Python process at a time.
New tools written in P/tools: rng.py (slices a dump by address range), dfn.py (disassembles functions by .pdata), sendmap.py (maps each caller of 0x1474a2190 to the message vtable it builds), slots.py (parses state-slot registrations), tostr.py (ToString field lists from vtable slot 3), vtof.py (RTTI class name for a vtable slot).

Field layouts:
- PreparingMissionEnd {+0x20 u8 CoopResult, +0x21 u8 MatchResult}
- KickPlayer {+0x20 u32 TargetNetworkId}
- RequestTeleportToRespawnPoint {+0x20 u32 PlayerStartNetworkId}
- TeleportToRespawnPoint {+0x20 int NewLocation[3], +0x2c float NewRotation[3]}
- RequestRespawn {+0x20 PlayerStartNetworkId, +0x24 RespawnCancel}
- Respawn {+0x20 NewLocation, +0x2c NewRotation, +0x38 RespawnCancel}
- EvaluationList {+0x20 EvaluationUsersList}
- EvaluationData {+0x20 SenderMemberId, +0x28 EvaluationAccumulateDataList}
- RealTime {+0x20 i64 RealTime}
- GameTime {+0x20 BeginningTime, +0x28 PhaseBeginningTime, +0x30 FinishTime, +0x38 bSetByHost}
- TimeUp {+0x20 Phase, +0x28 SendTime}
- ResultState {+0x20 SenderMemberId, +0x24 ResultState}
- EventHash {+0x20 PackageHash, +0x24 EventHash}
- SetObjectInformation {OwnersNetworkTypeId/Id, GameObjectId/SubId, MaxHealth +0x30, PlaneCost +0x34, Score +0x38, Faction +0x3c, EscortObject, GroupId, ParentNetworkTypeId/Id, DamageRateToParent +0x44, GameObjectCategory/SubCategory}
- LatencyCheck {SenderMemberId}
- LatencyResponse {+0x20 SenderTimeMs, +0x28 SenderMemberId, +0x2c ResponderMemberId}
- MissionRewardUser {UserId FString, Rewards}
- RespawnRescueTry {RescueNetworkTypeId/Id}; RespawnRescueResult {RescuedNetworkTypeId/Id}
- RespawnTimeEnd: no fields
- DestroyedLocation {int vector}
- ScoreAddition and ScoreUpdate {+0x20 ScoreData TArray}, element stride 0x10: {vt 0x14bfd7bf0, +0x8 u8 ScoreType, +0xc int32 Score}
- PauseTime {PauseType, bPause, SendTime, bSetByHost}
- IGCState {SenderMemberId, IGCHash, IGCState}
- GameModeState {SenderMemberId, GameModeState, RoundTripTime}
- PhaseState {SenderMemberId, PhaseIndex, PhaseState}

The Damage and DamageClient layouts are as already verified. Damage +0x34 Health is printed by ToString, but no client code writes or reads it.
